  m_Name: Kat_5
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::KatZinciriVarligi
  aciklama: "5. kat, daire 2, Cemal'in son \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131
    daire (mekanizma). Mutfak kilerdeki kolla a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r; salonun anahtar\u0131
    k\u0131r\u0131k, ba\u015F\u0131 buzdolab\u0131nda, ucu alet \xE7antas\u0131nda.
    Banyo i\xE7eriden kilitli: mente\u015Feler tornavidayla s\xF6k\xFCl\xFCr. Salondaki
    gard\u0131rop (levye kilerde, kayd\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 banyoda bulununca) itilince
    arkas\u0131nda ana vana; \xE7ark \xE7evrilince su kesilir, damla susar, lavabonun
    sifonu s\xF6k\xFCl\xFCr, i\xE7inde kat\u0131n anahtar\u0131. Oda A ve Oda B kapal\u0131."
